& [PostIR7ImplementationReadinessSurfaceV1] is the current implementation-readiness surface after IR7 implementation acceptance
  + [surface_state] is ready_for_IR8_final_slice_minting
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR2ParserProjectionImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR3OperatorHarnessImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR4LangGraphProofRuntimeImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR5SurfaceProjectionPrototypeImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR6CoordinationMailboxProjectionImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR7OperationsDryRunSimulatorImplementationProofPack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is IR7ImplementationCompletionReview
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is FSC5OperationsSafetyPackV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is PostIR6ImplementationReadinessSurfaceV1
  + [active_implementation_chunk] is IR8 integrated manager orchestration planning
  + [gated_chunk] is IR8 implementation activation until IR8 final planning is accepted
  + [gated_chunk] is operations adapter, transport, UI, dependency, and package metadata work until IR8 planning explicitly opens bounded non-live work
  + [gated_chunk] is live-control authority reconsideration until separate source-preserved SJS authority is accepted
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: mint IR8 final slices before writing integrated manager orchestration code, generated outputs, dependencies, adapters, transports, UI, package metadata, or machine-control code
  = must: run completion review after each IR8 planning slice before opening downstream slices
  = must: preserve parser/projection, operator harness, LangGraph proof runtime, surface projection, coordination mailbox, operations dry-run, and operations safety proof boundaries
  = must: preserve dry-run-only semantics for operation requests, resource reviews, human approvals, generated outputs, and fixture success
  = must: keep operations dry-run-only unless a separate future live-control authority is source-preserved, SJS-processed, least-privilege bounded, rollback-proved, and accepted

& [ImplementationReadinessChunk: IR8IntegratedManagerOrchestrationPlanning] is ready_for_slice_minting
  + [chunk_id] is IR8
  + [chunk_name] is integrated manager orchestration planning
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR2_Parser_Projection_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR3_Operator_Harness_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR4_LangGraph_Proof_Runtime_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR5_Surface_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/IR7_Operations_Dry_Run_Simulator_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/reviews/IR7_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/FSC5_Operations_Safety_Pack.v1.sop
  + [expected_output_set] is IR8 final slice surface
  + [expected_output_set] is integrated manager boundary import
  + [expected_output_set] is manager loop authority, readiness, packet, and proof contract
  + [expected_output_set] is coordination, surface, and operations dry-run handoff contract
  + [expected_output_set] is integrated manager fixture and trace plan
  + [expected_output_set] is implementation activation pack for future inert manager orchestration work
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is manager orchestration merges authority, readiness, graph execution, surface projection, coordination, operation dry-run evidence, and future dispatch boundaries
  + [future_bounded_fixture_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after IR8 boundary, manager loop, and handoff contracts are accepted
  + [forbidden_scope] is integrated manager implementation, dependency installation, package metadata mutation, generated output creation, adapter implementation, transport implementation, UI implementation, command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access or mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, operations control, and live machine control

  = must: split IR8 into final planning slices before implementation activation
  = must: preserve that manager orchestration plans work and records evidence; it does not dispatch agents, mutate resources, or control the live machine

& [IR8FinalSliceCandidateSet] is the recommended first final-slice minting shape for IR8
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S01 boundary import and proof-pack reconciliation
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S02 manager loop authority, readiness, and packet contract
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S03 coordination, surface, and operations dry-run handoff contract
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S04 integrated manager fixture, trace, and fault plan
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S05 implementation plan and activation pack
  + [slice_candidate] is IR8-S06 final planning completion review

  = must: keep IR8-S01, IR8-S02, IR8-S03, IR8-S05, and IR8-S06 under deeper reasoning
  = should: route bounded IR8-S04 fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after IR8-S01 through IR8-S03 are accepted
  = must: keep all slices non-mutating and non-live

& [IR8ReadinessSafetyBoundary] is the safety boundary for the opened IR8 planning chunk
  + [manager_loop_contract_authorized] is true_for_planning_only
  + [manager_readiness_projection_authorized] is true_for_planning_only
  + [work_packet_contract_authorized] is true_for_planning_only
  + [coordination_handoff_contract_authorized] is true_for_planning_only
  + [operations_dry_run_handoff_contract_authorized] is true_for_planning_only
  + [integrated_manager_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [fixture_file_creation_authorized] is false_until_IR8_final_slice_opens_it
  + [expected_ledger_creation_authorized] is false_until_IR8_final_slice_opens_it
  + [generated_output_creation_authorized] is false_until_future_implementation_activation
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat manager-loop outputs as planning and proof records, not commands
  = must: reject dry-run success, fixture success, projected user intent, broad approval, mailbox notice, claim state, or graph checkpoint state as dispatch authority or live-control authority
  = must: require separate future live-control authority before any live process, GPU, model runtime, job, credential, network, destructive filesystem, persistent automation, or machine-control effect

